| Loads the sound modules Folio reads aloud through, as !SoftMIDI does:
| SharedSound, StreamManager, then SharedSoundBuffer (only if the other two
| are there). SharedSoundBuffer and StreamManager are by John Duffell and
| aren't included (their terms don't allow it): see ReadMe.
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSound Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSound
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
Set Folio$SSB 1
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 Set Folio$SSB 0
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 Set Folio$SSB 0
If "<Folio$SSB>" = "1" Then RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer
Unset Folio$SSB
